  "title": "Vertiv Announces Date of First Quarter 2021 Earnings Release and Conference Call",
  "summary": "Vertiv Holdings Co (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure and continuity solutions, today announced it will report its first quarter 2021 results before market open on Wednesday, April 28, 2021. Vertiv’s management team will discuss the results during a conference call the same day, starting at 11 a.m. Eastern Time.",
